# Three Tetrad Classes

@top

![two gene classes](assets/lect09e-tetrad_visuals/two_gene_classes_large.drawn.svg)

@bottom

- *[PD]{color=#935D00}*: only parental combinations, ab and ++.
- *[NPD]{color=#007A00}*: only nonparental combinations, a+ and +b.
- *[TT]{color=#A719DB}*: all four combinations, one of each.

